{"word":"παράνομος","uri":"paranomos","senses":[{"word":"παράνομος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">παρά·νομος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος, ον,</span>\ncontraire à la loi <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> à la justice,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> inique, criminel,\nméchant, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">539</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐξωλέστατος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Flam.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">13 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\nchoses,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">284 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr. 344, 10</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> illégal, <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 17 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἀνόσιος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">684 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">à</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">δεινός,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">967 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">à</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἄδικος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ap.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">31</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">au plur.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τὰ παράνομα,</span> décret <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> loi contraire aux lois existantes, <span class=\"grec\">παράνομα γράφειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">573, 19,</span> présenter une loi contraire à\nla législation présente ; <span class=\"ital\">p. suite,<